; The fix station tree's sort and filter fixture. Its fixes are listed out of
; name order and out of coordinate order, and none names a *cs. The entry
; writes no *begin of its own, so st2, st1 and st10 belong to the source root,
; and north.svx's *begin block becomes the derived node north.
*fix st2 100 20 1
*fix st1 110 20 1
*fix st10 100 10 1
*data normal from to tape compass clino
st10 st2 10.0 0 0
st2 st1 10.0 90 0
*include "north"
